{3}{*hic* I should really stop drinkin' like this...}{*hic* I should really stop drinkin' like this...}{}{}{}{}
{4}{Hey! Chum! Got any peanuts to spare for ol' Skwerly? I'm hungry... *BURP!*}{Hey! Chum! Got any peanuts to spare for ol' Skwerly? I'm hungry... *BURP*}{}{}{}{}
{5}{*hic* damn hangover.. I guess I never learn to control me drinkin' *hic*.. }{*hic* damn hangover.. I guess I never learn to control me drinkin' *hic*.. }{}{}{}{}
{6}{Why do they always have to come pick me up and lock up here!? It's not like I can't take care o'meself! *BURP*}{Why do they always have to come pick me up and lock up here!? It's not like I can't take care o'meself! *BURP*}{}{}{}{}
{7}{I think I'm gonna puke again... *hic*}{I think I'm gonna puke again... *hic*}{}{}{}{}
{8}{Why did I have to drink so much again.. Me head is hurtin' like hell *hic*}{Why did I have to drink so much again.. Me head is hurtin' like hell *hic*}{}{}{}{}
{9}{*BURP*}{*BURP*}{}{}{}{}
{10}{Hey, chum! Could ye talk some sense into these bigoted morons? They're keepin' me here for nothin'!}{Hey, lass! Could ye talk some sense into these bigoted morons? They're keepin' me here for nothin'!}{}{}{}{}

