{21}{Let me outta here will ya!!? It ain't right for ye guys to cage up a poor defenseless critter like meself.}{Let me outta here will ya!!? It ain't right for ye guys to cage up a poor defenseless critter like meself.}{}{}{}{}
{22}{*BURP* 'ey, guard, mate! Ye got sum mo' booze fer ol' Skwerly?}{*BURP* 'ey, guard, mate! Ye got sum mo' booze fer ol' Skwerly?}{}{}{}{}
