{29}{I ain't done nothin' bad! Why can't a defenseless critter like meself get drunk in peace!? Ye don't have ta bring me 'ere every dang time, ye know?}{I ain't done nothin' bad! Why can't a defenseless critter like meself get drunk in peace!? Ye don't have ta bring me 'ere every dang time, ye know?}{}{}{}{}
